      "content": "I hear how exhausted you are, and it's okay to admit when the weight of being yourself feels too heavy to carry. You don't have to keep dragging through the mud if you're not ready to do it anymore; sometimes the bravest thing is to let go and rest. If you feel like you can't go on, please consider reaching out to a trusted friend or a mental health professional who can listen without judgment.",
