      "content": "\"lay down and let the world fade away\"... that sounds so peaceful. but it feels like everyone tells me i have to keep fighting, like i'm supposed to just keep pushing no matter how much i'm hurting. but what if there's nothing left to push with? what if the only way to actually get that peace you're talking about is to just... stop everything?",
